control: A backfill run's start masks every stale subject stored unmasked again from the store, a batch at a time, with a masking event for each mask
removes: the run-start step writes each subject it masks again with its masks applied and leaves it reading unmasked
packages: ./backfill/internal/pass2
tests: TestTheRunStartMasksTheSubjectsStoredUnmaskedAgainFromTheStore
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

